<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>ReLook — Best Prompt & Image Examples</title>
<style>
:root{--ink:#12161c;--paper:#f6f3ee;--line:#ded7cc;--accent:#d1452f;--muted:#6d6a64;}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.55 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;}
.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px 90px}
.hero{padding:72px 0 34px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.eyebrow{letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:11px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700}
h1{font-size:44px;line-height:1.05;margin:14px 0 12px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.lede{font-size:18px;color:var(--muted);max-width:62ch;margin:0}
.stats{display:flex;gap:34px;margin-top:26px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.stat b{display:block;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.stat span{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.11em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
.links{margin-top:26px;display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.links a{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);text-decoration:none;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}
.links a.ghost{background:none;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--line)}
nav{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:2px 20px;padding:26px 0 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
nav a{color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;font-size:13.5px;padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid transparent}
nav a:hover{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent)}
nav b{color:var(--accent);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;margin-right:7px}
.case{padding:46px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.case header{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start}
.num{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent);border:1.5px solid var(--accent);border-radius:50%;width:38px;height:38px;flex:0 0 38px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-top:3px}
h2{font-size:23px;margin:0 0 5px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.desc{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px}
.prompt{margin:18px 0 22px 56px;padding:13px 18px;background:#fff;border-left:3px solid var(--accent);font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#2b2f36}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(228px,1fr));gap:16px;margin-left:56px}
.t{text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);display:block}
.t img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:7px;background:#e8e3db;display:block;border:1px solid var(--line)}
.t video{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:7px;background:#000;display:block;border:1px solid var(--line)}
.t .ph{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;border-radius:7px;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;font-size:15px}
.t span{display:block;font-size:11.5px;margin-top:7px;letter-spacing:.03em;color:var(--muted)}
.t:hover img,.t:hover .ph{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}
.t.v span::before{content:"▶ ";color:var(--accent)}
.kPROMPT img{border-color:var(--accent);border-width:2px}
.kPROMPT span,.kAFTER span,.kRESULT span{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
.src{margin:20px 0 0 56px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
code{background:#fff;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-size:11.5px}
footer{padding:40px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
@media(max-width:700px){.prompt,.grid,.src{margin-left:0}h1{font-size:32px}}
</style></head><body><div class="wrap">
<div class="hero">
<div class="eyebrow">Harry the hirer · AI Champions · ReLook</div>
<h1>Best prompt &amp; image examples</h1>
<p class="lede">The strongest work from the department workshops, cut down to the examples worth showing.
Every case is a real job: the prompt that was typed, what went in, and what came out.</p>
<div class="stats">
<div class="stat"><b>24</b><span>Case studies</span></div>
<div class="stat"><b>115</b><span>Files</span></div>
<div class="stat"><b>10</b><span>Departments</span></div>
<div class="stat"><b>8</b><span>Cheat sheets</span></div>
</div>
<div class="links">
<a href="00%20Best%20Prompts%20Library.md">Best Prompts Library (copy-paste)</a>
<a class="ghost" href="00%20Cheat%20Sheets">Cheat sheets &amp; dept pages</a>
</div>
</div>
<nav><a href="#c01"><b>01</b> Sketch to 3D Render - Hand Sketch (Syd Exhibition)</a><a href="#c02"><b>02</b> Line Drawing to Branded Booth - 3 Stages (Syd Exhibition)</a><a href="#c03"><b>03</b> Interpolation - Sketch plus Photo (Syd Exhibition)</a><a href="#c04"><b>04</b> Element Swap - Stools from Reference (Melb Custom)</a><a href="#c05"><b>05</b> Material and Colour Change (Melb Custom)</a><a href="#c06"><b>06</b> Sketch Reference to Final Build (Melb Custom)</a><a href="#c07"><b>07</b> Sketch Inpaint - Add a Window (Melb Custom)</a><a href="#c08"><b>08</b> Facade Clean-up and Material Swap (Melb Custom)</a><a href="#c09"><b>09</b> Multi-Reference - New Screen plus New Background (Melb Custom Upgrades)</a><a href="#c10"><b>10</b> Multi-Image Panel Graphics (Syd and Melb Signage)</a><a href="#c11"><b>11</b> Remove People and Change Camera Angle (Melb Custom Upgrades)</a><a href="#c12"><b>12</b> Prompt Craft - Before and After Enhancement (Melb Custom Upgrades)</a><a href="#c13"><b>13</b> Aspect Ratio plus Colour Variants (Melb Events A)</a><a href="#c14"><b>14</b> Venue Placement - Booth into Real Venue (Melb Exhibition)</a><a href="#c15"><b>15</b> Camera Move - Move the Camera 10m Up (Melb Exhibition)</a><a href="#c16"><b>16</b> Sketch Inpaint - Add a Hanging Rig (Melb Exhibition)</a><a href="#c17"><b>17</b> Furniture and Colour Swap on Booth (Melb Exhibition)</a><a href="#c18"><b>18</b> Change Point of View (Syd Events)</a><a href="#c19"><b>19</b> Furniture Swap on Event Build (Syd Events)</a><a href="#c20"><b>20</b> Strip a Space Back to Empty (Syd Events)</a><a href="#c21"><b>21</b> CAD to Lit Production Render (Melb Production)</a><a href="#c22"><b>22</b> Signage Prompt Pattern Set A to H (Syd and Melb Signage)</a><a href="#c23"><b>23</b> Colour Variation Set - Aspen Booth (Syd Exhibition)</a><a href="#c24"><b>24</b> Lit Render with Animation (Syd Production)</a></nav>
<section class="case" id="c01">
<header><span class="num">01</span><div><h2>Sketch to 3D Render - Hand Sketch (Syd Exhibition)</h2><p class="desc">Turn a rough hand sketch into a photorealistic booth render.</p></div></header>
<blockquote class="prompt">Photorealistic 3D render of a modern exhibition booth based on a conceptual sketch. Realistic geometry, clean edges, accurate proportions.</blockquote>
<div class="grid"><a class="t kPROMPT" href="01%20Sketch%20to%203D%20Render%20-%20Hand%20Sketch%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/1%20PROMPT.png" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="01%20Sketch%20to%203D%20Render%20-%20Hand%20Sketch%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/1%20PROMPT.png" alt="1 PROMPT"><span>1 PROMPT</span></a><a class="t kBEFORE" href="01%20Sketch%20to%203D%20Render%20-%20Hand%20Sketch%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/2%20BEFORE%20-%20hand%20sketch.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="01%20Sketch%20to%203D%20Render%20-%20Hand%20Sketch%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/2%20BEFORE%20-%20hand%20sketch.jpg" alt="2 BEFORE - hand sketch"><span>2 BEFORE - hand sketch</span></a><a class="t kAFTER" href="01%20Sketch%20to%203D%20Render%20-%20Hand%20Sketch%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/3%20AFTER%20-%203D%20render.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="01%20Sketch%20to%203D%20Render%20-%20Hand%20Sketch%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/3%20AFTER%20-%203D%20render.jpg" alt="3 AFTER - 3D render"><span>3 AFTER - 3D render</span></a></div>
<p class="src">Source: Syd Exhibit Christine &nbsp;·&nbsp; folder <code>01 Sketch to 3D Render - Hand Sketch (Syd Exhibition)</code></p>
</section><section class="case" id="c02">
<header><span class="num">02</span><div><h2>Line Drawing to Branded Booth - 3 Stages (Syd Exhibition)</h2><p class="desc">Line drawing to neutral render to full branded render. The &#x27;generate neutral first&#x27; method.</p></div></header>
<blockquote class="prompt">Generate the rendered version of these line drawings, neutral colour palette → then apply the client branding as a second prompt.</blockquote>
<div class="grid"><a class="t kBEFORE" href="02%20Line%20Drawing%20to%20Branded%20Booth%20-%203%20Stages%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/1%20BEFORE%20-%20line%20drawing.png" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="02%20Line%20Drawing%20to%20Branded%20Booth%20-%203%20Stages%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/1%20BEFORE%20-%20line%20drawing.png" alt="1 BEFORE - line drawing"><span>1 BEFORE - line drawing</span></a><a class="t kAFTER" href="02%20Line%20Drawing%20to%20Branded%20Booth%20-%203%20Stages%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/2%20AFTER%20-%20neutral%20base%20render.jpeg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="02%20Line%20Drawing%20to%20Branded%20Booth%20-%203%20Stages%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/2%20AFTER%20-%20neutral%20base%20render.jpeg" alt="2 AFTER - neutral base render"><span>2 AFTER - neutral base render</span></a><a class="t kAFTER" href="02%20Line%20Drawing%20to%20Branded%20Booth%20-%203%20Stages%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/3%20AFTER%20-%20full%20render.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="02%20Line%20Drawing%20to%20Branded%20Booth%20-%203%20Stages%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/3%20AFTER%20-%20full%20render.jpg" alt="3 AFTER - full render"><span>3 AFTER - full render</span></a><a class="t kAFTER" href="02%20Line%20Drawing%20to%20Branded%20Booth%20-%203%20Stages%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/4%20AFTER%20-%20branded%20render.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="02%20Line%20Drawing%20to%20Branded%20Booth%20-%203%20Stages%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/4%20AFTER%20-%20branded%20render.jpg" alt="4 AFTER - branded render"><span>4 AFTER - branded render</span></a><div class="t v kVIDEO"><video controls preload="metadata" src="02%20Line%20Drawing%20to%20Branded%20Booth%20-%203%20Stages%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/5%20VIDEO%20-%20drawing%20to%20render.mp4"></video><span>5 VIDEO - drawing to render</span></div></div>
<p class="src">Source: Syd Exhibit Christine &nbsp;·&nbsp; folder <code>02 Line Drawing to Branded Booth - 3 Stages (Syd Exhibition)</code></p>
</section><section class="case" id="c03">
<header><span class="num">03</span><div><h2>Interpolation - Sketch plus Photo (Syd Exhibition)</h2><p class="desc">Combine a concept sketch with a branding reference into one render.</p></div></header>
<blockquote class="prompt">Generate a photorealistic 3D render of the 1st pic using the materials of the 2nd pic.</blockquote>
<div class="grid"><a class="t kPROMPT" href="03%20Interpolation%20-%20Sketch%20plus%20Photo%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/1%20PROMPT.png" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="03%20Interpolation%20-%20Sketch%20plus%20Photo%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/1%20PROMPT.png" alt="1 PROMPT"><span>1 PROMPT</span></a><a class="t kREFERENCE" href="03%20Interpolation%20-%20Sketch%20plus%20Photo%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/2%20REFERENCE%20-%20branding.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="03%20Interpolation%20-%20Sketch%20plus%20Photo%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/2%20REFERENCE%20-%20branding.jpg" alt="2 REFERENCE - branding"><span>2 REFERENCE - branding</span></a><a class="t kBEFORE" href="03%20Interpolation%20-%20Sketch%20plus%20Photo%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/3%20BEFORE%20-%20concept%20sketch.webp" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="03%20Interpolation%20-%20Sketch%20plus%20Photo%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/3%20BEFORE%20-%20concept%20sketch.webp" alt="3 BEFORE - concept sketch"><span>3 BEFORE - concept sketch</span></a><a class="t kAFTER" href="03%20Interpolation%20-%20Sketch%20plus%20Photo%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/4%20AFTER%20-%20interpolated%20render.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="03%20Interpolation%20-%20Sketch%20plus%20Photo%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/4%20AFTER%20-%20interpolated%20render.jpg" alt="4 AFTER - interpolated render"><span>4 AFTER - interpolated render</span></a></div>
<p class="src">Source: Syd Exhibit Christine &nbsp;·&nbsp; folder <code>03 Interpolation - Sketch plus Photo (Syd Exhibition)</code></p>
</section><section class="case" id="c04">
<header><span class="num">04</span><div><h2>Element Swap - Stools from Reference (Melb Custom)</h2><p class="desc">Multi-reference: pull furniture out of one photo and into another.</p></div></header>
<blockquote class="prompt">change the stools of the 1st pic with the stool in the 2nd pic</blockquote>
<div class="grid"><a class="t kPROMPT" href="04%20Element%20Swap%20-%20Stools%20from%20Reference%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/1%20PROMPT.png" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="04%20Element%20Swap%20-%20Stools%20from%20Reference%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/1%20PROMPT.png" alt="1 PROMPT"><span>1 PROMPT</span></a><a class="t kBEFORE" href="04%20Element%20Swap%20-%20Stools%20from%20Reference%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/2%20BEFORE.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="04%20Element%20Swap%20-%20Stools%20from%20Reference%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/2%20BEFORE.jpg" alt="2 BEFORE"><span>2 BEFORE</span></a><a class="t kAFTER" href="04%20Element%20Swap%20-%20Stools%20from%20Reference%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/3%20AFTER%20-%20stools%20swapped.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="04%20Element%20Swap%20-%20Stools%20from%20Reference%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/3%20AFTER%20-%20stools%20swapped.jpg" alt="3 AFTER - stools swapped"><span>3 AFTER - stools swapped</span></a></div>
<p class="src">Source: Melb Custom Thomas:Scotty &nbsp;·&nbsp; folder <code>04 Element Swap - Stools from Reference (Melb Custom)</code></p>
</section><section class="case" id="c05">
<header><span class="num">05</span><div><h2>Material and Colour Change (Melb Custom)</h2><p class="desc">Global finish swap across a whole scene in one prompt.</p></div></header>
<blockquote class="prompt">change all the metal finishing (background and base object) to black metal matte</blockquote>
<div class="grid"><a class="t kPROMPT" href="05%20Material%20and%20Colour%20Change%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/1%20PROMPT.png" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="05%20Material%20and%20Colour%20Change%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/1%20PROMPT.png" alt="1 PROMPT"><span>1 PROMPT</span></a><a class="t kBEFORE" href="05%20Material%20and%20Colour%20Change%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/2%20BEFORE.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="05%20Material%20and%20Colour%20Change%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/2%20BEFORE.jpg" alt="2 BEFORE"><span>2 BEFORE</span></a><a class="t kAFTER" href="05%20Material%20and%20Colour%20Change%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/3%20AFTER%20-%20colour%20changed.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="05%20Material%20and%20Colour%20Change%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/3%20AFTER%20-%20colour%20changed.jpg" alt="3 AFTER - colour changed"><span>3 AFTER - colour changed</span></a></div>
<p class="src">Source: Melb Custom Thomas:Scotty &nbsp;·&nbsp; folder <code>05 Material and Colour Change (Melb Custom)</code></p>
</section><section class="case" id="c06">
<header><span class="num">06</span><div><h2>Sketch Reference to Final Build (Melb Custom)</h2><p class="desc">Photo plus a drawn sketch reference producing the approved concept.</p></div></header>
<blockquote class="prompt">raise the height of the curved wall as per the pink sketch</blockquote>
<div class="grid"><a class="t kPROMPT" href="06%20Sketch%20Reference%20to%20Final%20Build%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/1%20PROMPT.png" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="06%20Sketch%20Reference%20to%20Final%20Build%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/1%20PROMPT.png" alt="1 PROMPT"><span>1 PROMPT</span></a><a class="t kBEFORE" href="06%20Sketch%20Reference%20to%20Final%20Build%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/2%20BEFORE.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="06%20Sketch%20Reference%20to%20Final%20Build%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/2%20BEFORE.jpg" alt="2 BEFORE"><span>2 BEFORE</span></a><a class="t kREFERENCE" href="06%20Sketch%20Reference%20to%20Final%20Build%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/3%20REFERENCE%20-%20sketch.jpeg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="06%20Sketch%20Reference%20to%20Final%20Build%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/3%20REFERENCE%20-%20sketch.jpeg" alt="3 REFERENCE - sketch"><span>3 REFERENCE - sketch</span></a><a class="t kAFTER" href="06%20Sketch%20Reference%20to%20Final%20Build%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/4%20AFTER%20-%20final%20result.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="06%20Sketch%20Reference%20to%20Final%20Build%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/4%20AFTER%20-%20final%20result.jpg" alt="4 AFTER - final result"><span>4 AFTER - final result</span></a></div>
<p class="src">Source: Melb Custom Thomas:Scotty &nbsp;·&nbsp; folder <code>06 Sketch Reference to Final Build (Melb Custom)</code></p>
</section><section class="case" id="c07">
<header><span class="num">07</span><div><h2>Sketch Inpaint - Add a Window (Melb Custom)</h2><p class="desc">Draw where the change goes, then ask for it. Also shows photo to 2D drawing.</p></div></header>
<blockquote class="prompt">Add a window to the area marked in the sketch · Change lighting to midday · Generate a 2D front elevation from this photo</blockquote>
<div class="grid"><a class="t kBEFORE" href="07%20Sketch%20Inpaint%20-%20Add%20a%20Window%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/1%20BEFORE.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="07%20Sketch%20Inpaint%20-%20Add%20a%20Window%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/1%20BEFORE.jpg" alt="1 BEFORE"><span>1 BEFORE</span></a><a class="t kREFERENCE" href="07%20Sketch%20Inpaint%20-%20Add%20a%20Window%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/2%20REFERENCE%20-%20sketch%20of%20window%20position.jpeg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="07%20Sketch%20Inpaint%20-%20Add%20a%20Window%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/2%20REFERENCE%20-%20sketch%20of%20window%20position.jpeg" alt="2 REFERENCE - sketch of window position"><span>2 REFERENCE - sketch of window position</span></a><a class="t kAFTER" href="07%20Sketch%20Inpaint%20-%20Add%20a%20Window%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/3%20AFTER%20-%20window%20added.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="07%20Sketch%20Inpaint%20-%20Add%20a%20Window%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/3%20AFTER%20-%20window%20added.jpg" alt="3 AFTER - window added"><span>3 AFTER - window added</span></a><a class="t kAFTER" href="07%20Sketch%20Inpaint%20-%20Add%20a%20Window%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/4%20AFTER%20-%20lighting%20changed.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="07%20Sketch%20Inpaint%20-%20Add%20a%20Window%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/4%20AFTER%20-%20lighting%20changed.jpg" alt="4 AFTER - lighting changed"><span>4 AFTER - lighting changed</span></a><a class="t kAFTER" href="07%20Sketch%20Inpaint%20-%20Add%20a%20Window%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/5%20AFTER%20-%20photo%20to%202D%20drawing.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="07%20Sketch%20Inpaint%20-%20Add%20a%20Window%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/5%20AFTER%20-%20photo%20to%202D%20drawing.jpg" alt="5 AFTER - photo to 2D drawing"><span>5 AFTER - photo to 2D drawing</span></a></div>
<p class="src">Source: Melb Custom Thomas:Scotty &nbsp;·&nbsp; folder <code>07 Sketch Inpaint - Add a Window (Melb Custom)</code></p>
</section><section class="case" id="c08">
<header><span class="num">08</span><div><h2>Facade Clean-up and Material Swap (Melb Custom)</h2><p class="desc">Remove clutter from a facade, then change its material.</p></div></header>
<blockquote class="prompt">Remove the clutter and show a clean finished setup → Change the exterior cladding to [new material]</blockquote>
<div class="grid"><a class="t kBEFORE" href="08%20Facade%20Clean-up%20and%20Material%20Swap%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/1%20BEFORE.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="08%20Facade%20Clean-up%20and%20Material%20Swap%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/1%20BEFORE.jpg" alt="1 BEFORE"><span>1 BEFORE</span></a><a class="t kAFTER" href="08%20Facade%20Clean-up%20and%20Material%20Swap%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/2%20AFTER%20-%20facade%20cleaned.png" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="08%20Facade%20Clean-up%20and%20Material%20Swap%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/2%20AFTER%20-%20facade%20cleaned.png" alt="2 AFTER - facade cleaned"><span>2 AFTER - facade cleaned</span></a><a class="t kAFTER" href="08%20Facade%20Clean-up%20and%20Material%20Swap%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/3%20AFTER%20-%20material%20changed.jpeg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="08%20Facade%20Clean-up%20and%20Material%20Swap%20%28Melb%20Custom%29/3%20AFTER%20-%20material%20changed.jpeg" alt="3 AFTER - material changed"><span>3 AFTER - material changed</span></a></div>
<p class="src">Source: Melb Custom Thomas:Scotty &nbsp;·&nbsp; folder <code>08 Facade Clean-up and Material Swap (Melb Custom)</code></p>
</section><section class="case" id="c09">
<header><span class="num">09</span><div><h2>Multi-Reference - New Screen plus New Background (Melb Custom Upgrades)</h2><p class="desc">Four inputs in one generation: base photo, background ref, screen ref, position sketch.</p></div></header>
<blockquote class="prompt">Use the background of the 2nd pic and place the screen from the 3rd pic where the sketch marks it.</blockquote>
