<header><span class="num">20</span><div><h2>Strip a Space Back to Empty (Syd Events)</h2><p class="desc">Remove all furniture to show the raw venue - useful for re-pitching a space.</p></div></header>
<blockquote class="prompt">Remove all the furniture and show the clean empty space</blockquote>
<div class="grid"><a class="t kPROMPT" href="20%20Strip%20a%20Space%20Back%20to%20Empty%20%28Syd%20Events%29/1%20PROMPT.png" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="20%20Strip%20a%20Space%20Back%20to%20Empty%20%28Syd%20Events%29/1%20PROMPT.png" alt="1 PROMPT"><span>1 PROMPT</span></a><a class="t kBEFORE" href="20%20Strip%20a%20Space%20Back%20to%20Empty%20%28Syd%20Events%29/2%20BEFORE.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="20%20Strip%20a%20Space%20Back%20to%20Empty%20%28Syd%20Events%29/2%20BEFORE.jpg" alt="2 BEFORE"><span>2 BEFORE</span></a><a class="t kAFTER" href="20%20Strip%20a%20Space%20Back%20to%20Empty%20%28Syd%20Events%29/3%20AFTER%20-%20furniture%20removed.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="20%20Strip%20a%20Space%20Back%20to%20Empty%20%28Syd%20Events%29/3%20AFTER%20-%20furniture%20removed.jpg" alt="3 AFTER - furniture removed"><span>3 AFTER - furniture removed</span></a><div class="t v kVIDEO"><video controls preload="metadata" src="20%20Strip%20a%20Space%20Back%20to%20Empty%20%28Syd%20Events%29/4%20VIDEO.mp4"></video><span>4 VIDEO</span></div></div>
