</section><section class="case" id="c21">
<header><span class="num">21</span><div><h2>CAD to Lit Production Render (Melb Production)</h2><p class="desc">Two techniques on the same Vectorworks CAD layout: sketch-inpaint light beams for quick internal checks, and the full master prompt for the hyper-realistic client-facing render.</p></div></header>
<blockquote class="prompt">1-2. Sketch inpaint (quick check): &quot;Generate light beams where the pink arrows are to illuminate the green grid on the floor, avoid the light to go beyond the green line boundary — remove the sketch marks.&quot;<br><br>7. Master prompt (client-facing render):<br>Create a hyper-realistic Polestar exhibition render.<br>ABSOLUTE MASTER LOCK: Image 1 defines everything. Do not change, move, scale, or redesign: stand layout, car positions, camera angle, signage placement, overall composition.<br>VEHICLES: Real production models only — Polestar 2, 3, 4. Exact positions, realistic proportions.<br>FLOOR (HARD RULE): Max 20mm height. Visually flush with surrounding floor. White glossy surface, soft reflections, thin metallic edge trim. Subtle shadow line only. If it looks raised → incorrect.<br>NO ADDITIONS: No furniture, barriers, props, extra signage, or decorations. Keep minimal.<br>LIGHTING: Black minimal architectural fittings. Warm-neutral white spotlights. Medium atmospheric haze for visible beams. Soft beam falloff.<br>PEOPLE: Walking naturally. Some crossing stand seamlessly (no step). Neutral modern clothing. Don&#x27;t overcrowd.<br>ENVIRONMENT: Large modern exhibition hall. Clean architecture. HDRI-style lighting. Slight cool tone.<br>CAMERA REALISM: Natural lens behaviour, soft highlights, micro-contrast, realistic depth, clean gradients. No stylisation.<br><br>Optional — if your tech drawings show a hanging lightbox, add:<br>LIGHTBOX: Suspended [Client] lightbox — black structure, white logo, even illumination. Must remain.</blockquote>
<div class="grid"><a class="t kPROMPT" href="21%20CAD%20to%20Lit%20Production%20Render%20%28Melb%20Production%29/1%20PROMPT%20-%20light%20beams.png" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="21%20CAD%20to%20Lit%20Production%20Render%20%28Melb%20Production%29/1%20PROMPT%20-%20light%20beams.png" alt="1 PROMPT - light beams"><span>1 PROMPT - light beams</span></a><a class="t kPROMPT" href="21%20CAD%20to%20Lit%20Production%20Render%20%28Melb%20Production%29/2%20PROMPT%20-%20beam%20zones.png" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="21%20CAD%20to%20Lit%20Production%20Render%20%28Melb%20Production%29/2%20PROMPT%20-%20beam%20zones.png" alt="2 PROMPT - beam zones"><span>2 PROMPT - beam zones</span></a><a class="t kBEFORE" href="21%20CAD%20to%20Lit%20Production%20Render%20%28Melb%20Production%29/3%20BEFORE%20-%20CAD%20layout.png" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="21%20CAD%20to%20Lit%20Production%20Render%20%28Melb%20Production%29/3%20BEFORE%20-%20CAD%20layout.png" alt="3 BEFORE - CAD layout"><span>3 BEFORE - CAD layout</span></a><a class="t kBEFORE" href="21%20CAD%20to%20Lit%20Production%20Render%20%28Melb%20Production%29/4%20BEFORE%20-%20CAD%20layout%202.png" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="21%20CAD%20to%20Lit%20Production%20Render%20%28Melb%20Production%29/4%20BEFORE%20-%20CAD%20layout%202.png" alt="4 BEFORE - CAD layout 2"><span>4 BEFORE - CAD layout 2</span></a><a class="t kAFTER" href="21%20CAD%20to%20Lit%20Production%20Render%20%28Melb%20Production%29/5%20AFTER%20-%20v1%20light%20beams.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="21%20CAD%20to%20Lit%20Production%20Render%20%28Melb%20Production%29/5%20AFTER%20-%20v1%20light%20beams.jpg" alt="5 AFTER - v1 light beams"><span>5 AFTER - v1 light beams</span></a><a class="t kAFTER" href="21%20CAD%20to%20Lit%20Production%20Render%20%28Melb%20Production%29/6%20AFTER%20-%20v2%20refined%20zones.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="21%20CAD%20to%20Lit%20Production%20Render%20%28Melb%20Production%29/6%20AFTER%20-%20v2%20refined%20zones.jpg" alt="6 AFTER - v2 refined zones"><span>6 AFTER - v2 refined zones</span></a><a class="t kAFTER" href="21%20CAD%20to%20Lit%20Production%20Render%20%28Melb%20Production%29/7%20AFTER%20-%20full%20exhibition%20render.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="21%20CAD%20to%20Lit%20Production%20Render%20%28Melb%20Production%29/7%20AFTER%20-%20full%20exhibition%20render.jpg" alt="7 AFTER - full exhibition render"><span>7 AFTER - full exhibition render</span></a><a class="t file kREFERENCE" href="21%20CAD%20to%20Lit%20Production%20Render%20%28Melb%20Production%29/8%20REFERENCE%20-%20Polestar%20option%20board.pdf" target="_blank"><div class="ph">PDF</div><span>8 REFERENCE - Polestar option board</span></a></div>
<p class="src">Source: Production Paul &nbsp;·&nbsp; folder <code>21 CAD to Lit Production Render (Melb Production)</code></p>
</section><section class="case" id="c22">
