g" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="22%20Signage%20Prompt%20Pattern%20Set%20A%20to%20H%20%28Syd%20and%20Melb%20Signage%29/3%20RESULT%20C.jpg" alt="3 RESULT C"><span>3 RESULT C</span></a><a class="t kPROMPT" href="22%20Signage%20Prompt%20Pattern%20Set%20A%20to%20H%20%28Syd%20and%20Melb%20Signage%29/4%20PROMPT%20D%20-%20background%20removal.png" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="22%20Signage%20Prompt%20Pattern%20Set%20A%20to%20H%20%28Syd%20and%20Melb%20Signage%29/4%20PROMPT%20D%20-%20background%20removal.png" alt="4 PROMPT D - background removal"><span>4 PROMPT D - background removal</span></a><a class="t kRESULT" href="22%20Signage%20Prompt%20Pattern%20Set%20A%20to%20H%20%28Syd%20and%20Melb%20Signage%29/4%20RESULT%20D.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="22%20Signage%20Prompt%20Pattern%20Set%20A%20to%20H%20%28Syd%20and%20Melb%20Signage%29/4%20RESULT%20D.jpg" alt="4 RESULT D"><span>4 RESULT D</span></a><a class="t kPROMPT" href="22%20Signage%20Prompt%20Pattern%20Set%20A%20to%20H%20%28Syd%20and%20Melb%20Signage%29/5%20PROMPT%20E%20-%20furniture%20swap.png" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="22%20Signage%20Prompt%20Pattern%20Set%20A%20to%20H%20%28Syd%20and%20Melb%20Signage%29/5%20PROMPT%20E%20-%20furniture%20swap.png" alt="5 PROMPT E - furniture swap"><span>5 PROMPT E - furniture swap</span></a><a class="t kRESULT" href="22%20Signage%20Prompt%20Pattern%20Set%20A%20to%20H%20%28Syd%20and%20Melb%20Signage%29/5%20RESULT%20E.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="22%20Signage%20Prompt%20Pattern%20Set%20A%20to%20H%20%28Syd%20and%20Melb%20Signage%29/5%20RESULT%20E.jpg" alt="5 RESULT E"><span>5 RESULT E</span></a><a class="t kPROMPT" href="22%20Signage%20Prompt%20Pattern%20Set%20A%20to%20H%20%28Syd%20and%20Melb%20Signage%29/6%20PROMPT%20F%20-%20material%20finish.png" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="22%20Signage%20Prompt%20Pattern%20Set%20A%20to%20H%20%28Syd%20and%20Melb%20Signage%29/6%20PROMPT%20F%20-%20material%20finish.png" alt="6 PROMPT F - material finish"><span>6 PROMPT F - material finish</span></a><a class="t kRESULT" href="22%20Signage%20Prompt%20Pattern%20Set%20A%20to%20H%20%28Syd%20and%20Melb%20Signage%29/6%20RESULT%20F.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="22%20Signage%20Prompt%20Pattern%20Set%20A%20to%20H%20%28Syd%20and%20Melb%20Signage%29/6%20RESULT%20F.jpg" alt="6 RESULT F"><span>6 RESULT F</span></a><a class="t kPROMPT" href="22%20Signage%20Prompt%20Pattern%20Set%20A%20to%20H%20%28Syd%20and%20Melb%20Signage%29/7%20PROMPT%20G%20-%20panel%20graphics.png" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="22%20Signage%20Prompt%20Pattern%20Set%20A%20to%20H%20%28Syd%20and%20Melb%20Signage%29/7%20PROMPT%20G%20-%20panel%20graphics.png" alt="7 PROMPT G - panel graphics"><span>7 PROMPT G - panel graphics</span></a><a class="t kRESULT" href="22%20Signage%20Prompt%20Pattern%20Set%20A%20to%20H%20%28Syd%20and%20Melb%20Signage%29/7%20RESULT%20G1.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="22%20Signage%20Prompt%20Pattern%20Set%20A%20to%20H%20%28Syd%20and%20Melb%20Signage%29/7%20RESULT%20G1.jpg" alt="7 RESULT G1"><span>7 RESULT G1</span></a><a class="t kRESULT" href="22%20Signage%20Prompt%20Pattern%20Set%20A%20to%20H%20%28Syd%20and%20Melb%20Signage%29/7%20RESULT%20G2.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="22%20Signage%20Prompt%20Pattern%20Set%20A%20to%20H%20%28Syd%20and%20Melb%20Signage%29/7%20RESULT%20G2.jpg" alt="7 RESULT G2"><span>7 RESULT G2</span></a><a class="t kPROMPT" href="22%20Signage%20Prompt%20Pattern%20Set%20A%20to%20H%20%28Syd%20and%20Melb%20Signage%29/8%20PROMPT%20H%20-%20sketch%20to%20render.png" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="22%20Signage%20Prompt%20Pattern%20Set%20A%20to%20H%20%28Syd%20and%20Melb%20Signage%29/8%20PROMPT%20H%20-%20sketch%20to%20render.png" alt="8 PROMPT H - sketch to render"><span>8 PROMPT H - sketch to render</span></a><a class="t kRESULT" href="22%20Signage%20Prompt%20Pattern%20Set%20A%20to%20H%20%28Syd%20and%20Melb%20Signage%29/8%20RESULT%20