<header><span class="num">23</span><div><h2>Colour Variation Set - Aspen Booth (Syd Exhibition)</h2><p class="desc">A 2D line drawing regenerated as multiple colourway options from one render — with the animated walkthrough.</p></div></header>
<blockquote class="prompt">Show the same booth in [navy / charcoal / white gloss / timber] — keep structure and layout identical. Generate 3–5 colourways from one render — present as an options board.</blockquote>
<div class="grid"><a class="t kBEFORE" href="23%20Colour%20Variation%20Set%20-%20Aspen%20Booth%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/1%20BEFORE%20-%202D%20line%20drawing.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="23%20Colour%20Variation%20Set%20-%20Aspen%20Booth%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/1%20BEFORE%20-%202D%20line%20drawing.jpg" alt="1 BEFORE - 2D line drawing"><span>1 BEFORE - 2D line drawing</span></a><a class="t kAFTER" href="23%20Colour%20Variation%20Set%20-%20Aspen%20Booth%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/2%20AFTER%20-%20variation%201.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="23%20Colour%20Variation%20Set%20-%20Aspen%20Booth%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/2%20AFTER%20-%20variation%201.jpg" alt="2 AFTER - variation 1"><span>2 AFTER - variation 1</span></a><a class="t kAFTER" href="23%20Colour%20Variation%20Set%20-%20Aspen%20Booth%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/3%20AFTER%20-%20variation%202.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="23%20Colour%20Variation%20Set%20-%20Aspen%20Booth%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/3%20AFTER%20-%20variation%202.jpg" alt="3 AFTER - variation 2"><span>3 AFTER - variation 2</span></a><a class="t kAFTER" href="23%20Colour%20Variation%20Set%20-%20Aspen%20Booth%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/4%20AFTER%20-%20variation%203.jpg" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="23%20Colour%20Variation%20Set%20-%20Aspen%20Booth%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/4%20AFTER%20-%20variation%203.jpg" alt="4 AFTER - variation 3"><span>4 AFTER - variation 3</span></a><div class="t v kVIDEO"><video controls preload="metadata" src="23%20Colour%20Variation%20Set%20-%20Aspen%20Booth%20%28Syd%20Exhibition%29/5%20VIDEO%20-%20Aspen%20booth.mp4"></video><span>5 VIDEO - Aspen booth</span></div></div>
